	(text "Power Down Mode \ndatasheet quote:\n\nTo initiate hardware \npower-down, \nthe PWDN pin (pin B6)\nmust be tied to high. \nWhen this occurs, the OV2640\ninternal device clock is halted \nand all internal counters are\nreset. The current draw is less \nthan 15 µA in this standby mode"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 55.118 283.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
